    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Pleomorphic adenoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "This ultrasound shows a well-defined, solid mass that is hypoechoic compared with adjacent salivary tissue, with homogeneous internal echoes.",
    "source": "Lester D.R. Thompson",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "",
