    "fileId": 27746,
    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Pleomorphic adenoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Palate tumours very frequently show a predominant plasmacytoid population, although small ducts can be seen in this tumour.",
    "source": "Lester D.R. Thompson",
    "copyright": "",
